      "properties": {"text": ""},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LTX-2 MLX — Text to Video\n\nRequires macOS on Apple Silicon (arm64), ComfyUI-LTXVideo-style env setup per this pack's README, and ltx-2-mlx weights downloaded (dgrauet/ltx-2.3-mlx-q8 here).\n\nLTX2MLXGenerate saves + previews the video itself (is_output_node) -- no separate SaveVideo/PreviewVideo node is needed downstream.\n\nThis example uses tiny settings (256x256, 25 frames, distilled pipeline) to keep runtime short. For production quality, expect much longer render times and higher memory pressure -- see this pack's README / the parent repo's MLX_INTEGRATION_NOTES.md for the two_stage/q8 8h+ render investigation."
      ]
    }
